# Tenancy & RLS

- Every tenant-owned table has non-null `workspace_id`
- ENABLE RLS and FORCE RLS on all applicable tenant tables
- App filters are not enough — RLS is the backstop
- Cross-workspace reads/writes must fail closed
- Infrastructure-only tables (e.g. global worker registry) must be explicitly justified and locked down
